# launcher crash reports uploaded by players at runtime (never commit player data)
Qahr6609.Tools/Server/PatchServer/www/data/crashes/

# released tools: binaries are published as zip (GitHub Releases), only the launch scripts and README are in git
Qahr6609.Tools/Releases/*/

# ---- public repo (README.md): things that are kept on disk but never published ----
# DevExpress v21.2 (commercial, licensed per developer): the optional GM panel builds only when these are in libs\
Qahr6609.GameServer/libs/DevExpress*.dll
*.licx
# build outputs of the tools whose sources are here (rebuild with their build.bat / csproj)
*.exe
*.pdb
# closed tool without source (ServerIpTool drag-and-drop exe) is covered by *.exe
# archives / old copies / caches
*.zip
*.7z
*.old
__pycache__/
*.pyc
Qahr6609.Tools/_Archive/
# old NuGet packages folder (the server uses PackageReference, restored from nuget.org)
Qahr6609.GameServer/packages/
# database dumps with data (only Qahr6609.Shared/Database/cq.sql, schema + game seed rows, is published)
/*.sql
*dump*.sql
cq_*.sql
*.sql.gz
# website API (Qahr6609.Tools\Web\QahrWebApi\README_AR.md): the real key never goes into git
